#: ../../../userspace-api/liveupdate:15: ../include/uapi/linux/liveupdate.h:72
msgid ""
"Creates a new live update session for managing preserved resources. This "
"ioctl can only be called on the main /dev/liveupdate device."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../userspace-api/liveupdate:15: ../include/uapi/linux/liveupdate.h:75
